<p>The power of the Fearscape infuses your weapon: Your melee attacks will deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 37, 42, 46</acronym> fire damage, spread over 3 turns.</p><p>Additionally, every time you attack, there is a 25% chance of releasing a burst of powerful fire that will deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">90, 121, 145, 165, 183</acronym> fire damage to all enemies in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> over 3 turns.</p><p>If this talent is not on cooldown, the burst of fire will instead be radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 4,</acronym> and stun all targets in addition to burning them.</p><p>For the purposes of applying the stun, you have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 15, 20, 25</acronym> bonus spellpower.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>